### Get Categories
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories

### Get Products (All)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products

### Get Products with invalid sort
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?sort=invalid_sort

### Get Products page beyond end
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?page=100

### Get Hero Laptops (Laptops under 1000 with 16GB RAM)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?category=2&maxPrice=1000&q=16GB
